  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Food Programme Operations in Darfur.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve food consumption for people recently displaced in Darfur, Sudan, by providing food vouchers to 440,000 beneficiaries (for seven months) and distribute food to 980,000 people (for three months) in sufficient quantity, quality and in a timely manner. This will contribute to the Millennium Development Goal n.1 that is eradicate extreme poverty and hunger by reducing the proportion of people without food.</narrative>
  </description>
